    <sub-title lang="fr">Jaisalmer: India's Hidden Gem</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Every major country has a destination that is incredible but not well known to outsiders—Jaisalmer is such a place. Once a major stop along the silk road, this living museum and surrounding countryside has something for everyone: tragic history, unbelievable architecture, unique cultural groups and resilient wildlife.</desc>
